      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gifford%2C_Illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The tornado hit just before 1:00 PM, yet remarkably no one was seriously injured in the village.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
